note Creating an anchor records the author it is given and picks the innermost symbol whose range contains the slice and stores offsets from that symbol's first line. With no containing symbol the offsets are absolute and the anchor is as fragile as a line number, which is why whole-symbol steps are preferred.

step 9o0i08
