file src/map.rs
symbol Anchor
lines 0 17
hash efc17902f6b48808
note The stored half is the id, the order, file, symbol, the two offsets and the hash, plus the note, the author, the parent that makes a path a tree, and the link to another path. The id is set once when the step is made and is how the file names a parent and how diff matches a step; order places it in the step list, ordering siblings the code does not, and is set once to one past the highest in the path, after which only a swap changes it. An empty symbol means the offsets are absolute lines; an empty link means none. line_start, line_end, stale and sym (the index of the resolved symbol in its file's symbol list) are filled in per session by resolve and never written to disk.

